body:
### Description

I put together https://github.com/carloslfu/aven to test Claude's computer use capabilities using the AI SDK. At first, I hacked my way to it, but the behavior seems to continue even after updating to the latest release.

The problem is when you return an image from the computer tool to return the screenshot. Here is the diff of the updated version: https://github.com/carloslfu/aven/commit/ce71f88561b0be899f3412898a5156ce08202790#diff-26ad4b834941d9b19ebf9db8082bd202aaf72ea0ddea85f5a8a0cb3c729cc6f2R306

![Screenshot 2024-10-27 at 9 43 40 AM](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fb93bfe7-0cd8-465c-bdcd-66c84cfd2134)

Here is the full file: https://github.com/carloslfu/aven/blob/remove-tool-response-workaround/src/App.tsx#L306

I inspected the outgoing request, and the problem is that the `tool_result` content is being sent as a string, not as an array. Here is the request body:

```json
{
  "model": "claude-3-5-sonnet-20241022",
  "max_tokens": 8192,
  "temperature": 0,
  "system": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "You are a helpful assistant that can control the computer.\n\n<SYSTEM_CAPABILITY>\n ..."
    }
  ],
  "messages": [
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "type hello world in textedit"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "assistant", 
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "text": "I'll help you type \"hello world\" in TextEdit. Let me break this down into steps:\n\n1. First, I need to take a screenshot to see the current state of the desktop\n2. Find and click on TextEdit\n3. Wait for it to open\n4. Type \"hello world\"\n\nLet's start:"
        },
        {
          "type": "tool_use",
          "id": "toolu_01791VbzhLRZBfycSKSrgMVd",
          "name": "computer",
          "input": {
            "action": "screenshot"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": [
        {
          "type": "tool_result",
          "tool_use_id": "toolu_01791VbzhLRZBfycSKSrgMVd",
          "content": "[{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":\"iVBORw0KGgoAAA...\",\"mimeType\":\"image/png\"}]"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "tools": [
    {
      "name": "computer",
      "type": "computer_20241022",
      "display_width_px": 1920,
      "display_height_px": 1080
    }
  ],
  "tool_choice": {
    "type": "auto"
  },
  "stream": true
}
```

